    <chapter xml:id="linear-systems-applications-and-independence">
      <title>Linear Systems, Applications, and Independence</title>
        <introduction><p>In this unit we will explore linear systems, their applications, 
          and the concept of vector independence.</p>
        <p>There are four learning outcomes for this unit:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><p>Systems of Linear Equations</p></li>
          <li><p>Linear Independence</p></li>
          <li><p>Transformations of Linear Systems</p></li>
          <li><p>Applications of Linear Systems</p></li>
        </ul>
        </introduction>
        <xi:include href="./lsai-outcomes/lsai1-materials.ptx" />
    </chapter>

